{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新疆的阿合牙孜河，猶如翡翠般清澈透亮，而特克斯河則含有大量泥沙。兩條河流的交匯處，黃藍分明、一清一濁，上演大自然的「鴛鴦鍋」景觀。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_P.XJ.RIVER.MTV.0914-1006_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264ID1buxj8f1791250943.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_P.XJ.RIVER.MTV.0914-1006_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T02:39:10.340184+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":65,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}